# Review ownership.
#
# The paths below decide what a change can affect, and the first two run with
# repository permissions once merged — a workflow can publish a release and the
# installer writes into a user's harness home — so they always warrant a human
# read, never auto-merge.

/.github/                    @cmukanisa
/install.sh                  @cmukanisa
/install.mjs                 @cmukanisa
/patch/                      @cmukanisa
/packages/                   @cmukanisa
/SECURITY.md                 @cmukanisa
